# Agent skills belong to the ueca-react package, not to this repository. They are installed by
# "npx ueca-react-skills" (our postinstall runs it) and replaced wholesale on upgrade, so nothing
# under here is ever committed - naming the directory rather than each skill also covers any skill
# a later release adds. Do not edit in place. To track a skill of our own, un-ignore it explicitly:
#     !.claude/skills/<our-skill>/
.claude/skills/
